Troubleshooting
Issue: GeoIP library not working

Solution: This is optional. The script works without it, just won't show country/city data
Issue: No connections parsed

Solution: Check log file format matches expected pattern. Verify file exists and is readable
Issue: JSON file empty

Solution: Ensure log file has valid entries. Check file permissions
Issue: Import errors

Solution: Reinstall Python libraries: pip3 install --user maxminddb-geolite2
